<p>A <a href="https://example.com"> linked body </a> keeps the padding
of its content.</p>
<p>A box holds <span class="box"> its own spacing </span> within the
line.</p>
<p>An underlined <u> padded body </u> sits beside plain words.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>A spaced quotation.</p>
<p>—  A. Author </p>
</blockquote>
<p>A footnote body is trimmed <a href="#fn1" class="footnote-ref"
id="fnref1" role="doc-noteref"><sup>1</sup></a> here.</p>
<figure>
<p><img src="diagram.png" /></p>
<figcaption><p>Figure caption.</p></figcaption>
</figure>
<p>Loop rounds join with their padding: 1 2 3 .</p>
<p>A measurement of 6.0em, a ratio of 50%, and 1.5e-2 exact.</p>
<p><img src="diagram.png" style="width:1000pt" /></p>
<p>The binding kept survives its statement.</p>
